\"order: 0;\"> <div data-part=\"role\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--role obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>适用角色</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method obc-tmpl-weapon__role-table\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\"><div class=\"role-icon-td\"><div><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/09/27/75940953/3fd4600b5812710aae95985653141cff_3012466046177802879.png\" alt=\"\"></div> <span>暮光骑士·月煌</span></div></td> <td><div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__role-stars\"><span>推荐指数</span> <div><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i></div></div></td> <td colspan=\"3\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">被动技能提供全伤和可叠加的物伤加成，主动技能倍率高打hit数高</p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 1;\"> <div data-part=\"review\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--review obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器测评</h2> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-container\"><div><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/09/10/75940953/82325eeeb967160afa65af38f8ae212c_3788695798362012171.gif\" class=\"mobile-gif\"></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc\"><div class=\"text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">物理输出向通用武器，主动技能总共能造成3200%倍率的高额物理伤害，被动还能提供全伤害以及物理伤害加成，在物理方面拥有极高的通用性</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">除高额倍率之外，还拥有快速叠连击这一功能，完美契合【暮光骑士·月煌】对连击的高需求，其他特定需要连击的战场阵容也可以当作工具使用。</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\"></p></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc-gif\" style=\"padding: 0px;\"><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/09/10/75940953/82325eeeb967160afa65af38f8ae212c_3788695798362012171.gif\" alt=\"\"></div></div></div></div> <!----></div></div></div></di